## 4. Prohibition on Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning Use

You may not use the Software or any portion thereof for AI Training.

Without limiting the foregoing, You may not:

1. include the Software in a dataset intended for AI Training;
2. use the Software as training or fine-tuning data;
3. use the Software to train, fine-tune, or improve an AI System;
4. use the Software to create embeddings or representations intended to train or improve an AI System;
5. use the Software as an evaluation or benchmark dataset where the purpose is to develop or improve an AI System;
6. scrape, crawl, collect, or systematically extract the Software for the purpose of AI Training;
7. redistribute the Software as part of an AI-training dataset; or
8. authorize or facilitate any third party to perform any of the above activities.

This restriction applies regardless of whether the AI System or AI Training is commercial or non-commercial.

